  "description": "FluentResults Helpers Package is a lightweight, intuitive utility library designed to extend and simplify your experience when working with the FluentResults package. This package provides a rich set of helper methods and extension functions that make it easier to manage results and errors in a fluent, expressive manner. With its clear, developer-friendly API, you can effortlessly convert exceptions into results, chain multiple results together, combine error messages, and apply custom filters and transformations.",
